@node Additional material
@unnumbered Additional material
The Scheme community website at @url{https://scheme.org} contains
additional resources for learning and programming, job and event
postings, and Scheme user group information.

A bibliography of Scheme-related research at
@url{http://library.readscheme.org} links to technical papers and theses
related to the Scheme language, including both classic papers and recent
research.

On-line Scheme discussions are held using @acronym{IRC,Internet Relay
Chat} on the @nc{#scheme} channel at @url{irc.freenode.net} [now (2024)
at @url{https://libera.chat}] and on the Usenet discussion group
@t{comp.lang.scheme}.
